post.append('Every attempted path edge receives at least 65 s with RRT restarts, staging and shortcutting. Accepted paths undergo ≤4 mm model-derived point-displacement sampling, joint-range, load-envelope and grip replay. A missing OEM actuator or ownership binding is reported as blocked, not as a fictitious 65-second RRT failure. Working contact is absent from non-working paths; contact windows retain their own kind, object and support and the ≤50 mm normal/insertion rule. The rotated dock test rejects the back, side and wrong object. Door tests reject 5, 7.5, 9 and 9.9 mm and accept the unchanged 10 mm gate. [Policy regression](../../sim/r07/integrator/results/contact_policy_regression.json), [door regression](../../sim/r07/integrator/results/door_gate_regression_v4.json), [rotated faces](../../sim/r07/integrator/results/rotated_contact_regression_v4.json).')
