post.append(f"Executed full-meal **prep_min=null**. The sum of checked isolated path durations is {schedule.get('isolated_path_sum_s',0)/60:.3f} min, which is not a meal makespan. Timing applies home-tier rail 0.1 m/s, joints 0.35 rad/s and all-point 0.05 m/s with acceleration limits to saved paths. Required 600 s bok-choy soak, three conservative fresh potato rinses and 20–30 s drain remain. Peeler cycle, batch slicing, fill/drain and inspection durations are unqualified, so none is invented to complete a schedule. [Schedule](../../sim/r07/integrator/results/schedule.json).")
